            Three to five acres of open grass mowed every week points to the TITAN MAX. One to three acres with a gate to get through points to the IKON XD 52 or the Z254F, with the Ariens edging ahead on deck value and the Husqvarna on its Kawasaki engine. If the closest shop that can fix a mower in July is a Deere dealer, the Z530M earns its premium. The Ultima ZT1 suits a flat lot where price is the main limit, and the EGO Z6 suits a mid-size lawn whose owner is done with small engines.
